      "detail": "Founding writes region/kind/founded_turn/founder/name once and appends; falls retain the seat, changes of patron/level/refugees/carries preserve founding fields. Rebuilding appends a distinct index. Current production code does not rename Seat.name or reorder the seat registry. These models are not frozen Python objects; this is an ordinary-writer convention validated against retained births.",
