      "detail": "Paid turns are started_turn+6k and seasons are floor((turn mod12)/3), so exactly two opposite seasons are reachable under an unchanged anchor. Claims in the other two seasons cannot receive paid allocation under that cadence. The conditional default-calendar example shows that this does not universally prevent later-cycle evidence use within180 turns. No eligibility, cadence or gate change is proposed by this audit.",
